---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CourseSidebar from '../../../components/CourseSidebar.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Advanced Practice Plan" sidebar>
  <CourseSidebar slot="sidebar" active="advanced-plan" />

  <h1>Advanced Practice Plan</h1>

  <h2>Holding at Dantian Stage</h2>
  <table>
    <tr><th>Phase</th><th>Duration</th><th>Warm-Up</th><th>Key Points</th></tr>
    <tr><td>Weeks 1-2</td><td>5-10 minutes</td><td>Knee Rotation + Natural Punching</td><td>Adjust to cradling a ball at the Dantian</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Weeks 3-4</td><td>10-15 minutes</td><td>+ Side Shaking</td><td>Don't crush or drop the ball; sink shoulders, drop elbows</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Weeks 5-8</td><td>15-20 minutes</td><td>Full warm-up set</td><td>Feel the warmth at the Dantian</td></tr>
  </table>

  <h2>Five-Posture Flow Stage</h2>
  <table>
    <tr><th>Phase</th><th>Content</th><th>Total Duration</th><th>Frequency</th></tr>
    <tr><td>Initial</td><td>3 minutes per posture + warm-up and cool-down</td><td>~20 minutes</td><td>Every other day</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Intermediate</td><td>5 minutes per posture + warm-up and cool-down</td><td>~35 minutes</td><td>Daily</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Long-term</td><td>5-10 minutes per posture + full warm-up and cool-down</td><td>40-60 minutes</td><td>Daily</td></tr>
  </table>

  <h2>Long-Term Practice Principles</h2>
  <ul class="key-points">
    <li>As with all good disciplines, <strong>consistency</strong> is the most important factor</li>
    <li>Do not rush for results — Zhan Zhuang works on internal energy patterns, and outward effects typically appear after months</li>
    <li>Integrate Zhan Zhuang into daily life, making it a daily habit</li>
    <li>Continue developing inner strength throughout your life</li>
    <li>Keep a practice journal to observe long-term changes</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="callout">
    <h4>Master Lam's Ultimate Message</h4>
    <p>The meaning of "stand like a tree" is this: outwardly you may appear unchanging and completely still,
    yet inwardly you are continuously growing and filling with energy.
    Through this simple practice, everyone can achieve deep harmony and health of body and mind.</p>
  </div>

  <p style="margin-top: 2rem;">
    <a href="/application">→ Daily Application: Bringing Zhan Zhuang Principles into Life</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;
    <a href="/further-learning">→ Further Learning: Advanced Resources</a>
  </p>
</BaseLayout>